{"id":"violencia","lemma":"violencia","pos":"noun","rank":1415,"glosses":["violence","act of violence"],"ipa":"/bjoˈlenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"violencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-violencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Nos disgusta la violencia.","en":"We dislike violence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453540"},{"text":"No nos gusta la violencia.","en":"We don't like violence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460099"},{"text":"La violencia engendra más violencia.","en":"Violence breeds more violence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585800"},{"text":"No puedo soportar más su violencia.","en":"I can't put up with his violence any longer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527157"},{"text":"La violencia es el cáncer de nuestra sociedad.","en":"Violence is the cancer of our society.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706080"}]}